⊢ gram_surgery(󱁕,holes=□,𝙥=0):  holes: [(pos,size)]
    ⊢ ƒ(󱁕):
        nonlocal 𝙥
        ¿␛p∉󱁕ᵉ: ↪
        ¿󱁕∧¬󱁕ᵉ ᵀ:
            ∀c∈󱁕:ƒ(c)
            α,β = 󱁕.farnodes
            ¿␛p∈αᵉ∧βᵉ∋␛p: 󱁕ᵉ ᵖ = (αᵉ ᵖ₀,βᵉ ᵖ₁)
            ↪
        l,r = 󱁕ᵉ ᵖ = (󱁕ᵉ ᵖ₀+𝙥, 󱁕ᵉ ᵖ₁+𝙥)
        ➰holes ∧ holes₀ ₀≤l:
            𝙥󷸊+Δ≔holes.pop(0)₁
            󱁕ᵉ ᵖ = l,r = l+Δ,r+Δ
    ƒ(󱁕)
    ↪󱁕

⊢ under_gram(󱁕):  I:insert [add stuff to make not ctx-sens]
                  R:remove [remove comments n stuff]
